WEBVTT

00:07.833 --> 00:09.000
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.000 --> 00:10.700
all: Aye, aye, Captain!
全体：是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.700 --> 00:14.267
- I can't hear you.
all: Aye, aye, Captain!
- 我听不到你说话。
全体：是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.267 --> 00:17.300
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

00:17.300 --> 00:19.500
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.500 --> 00:21.500
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:21.500 --> 00:23.333
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.333 --> 00:25.267
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:25.267 --> 00:27.300
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.300 --> 00:28.933
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:28.933 --> 00:31.500
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.500 --> 00:33.467
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.467 --> 00:35.700
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:35.700 --> 00:37.633
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.633 --> 00:39.600
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.600 --> 00:40.800
- * SpongeBob
- * 海绵宝宝

00:40.800 --> 00:43.033
* SquarePants!
* 方裤！

00:43.033 --> 00:45.600
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.600 --> 00:47.267
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
