00:47.267 --> 00:48.400
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.033 --> 00:55.033
[upbeat ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

00:55.033 --> 01:02.500
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
