01:02.500 --> 01:05.867
- * La da dee, la da dum,
la da doo *
- * La da dee, la da dum,
拉达杜*

01:05.867 --> 01:08.100
* La da dee,
la da dum, la da doo *
*拉达迪，
拉达杜姆，拉达杜*

01:08.100 --> 01:09.100
[timer dings]
[计时器的声音]

01:09.100 --> 01:12.533
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

01:12.533 --> 01:14.100
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

01:14.100 --> 01:16.567
Ah!
啊!

01:25.167 --> 01:26.167
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

01:26.167 --> 01:27.900
Huh?
[grumbles]
啊？
[抱怨]

01:30.933 --> 01:34.067
- Hey!
- 嘿！

01:34.067 --> 01:36.433
Whatcha doing?
干啥呢？

01:36.433 --> 01:38.100
- I'm busy!
- 我很忙！

01:38.100 --> 01:39.467
- How busy
would you say you are
- 多么忙
你会说你是吗

01:39.467 --> 01:40.967
on a scale of eight to nine?
在八到九的范围内？

01:40.967 --> 01:42.267
- 14!
- 14！
- 14！
- 14！
- 14！
- 14！
- 14！
- 14！

01:42.267 --> 01:43.833
- Squidward,
I'm no mathematologist
- 章鱼哥，
我不是数学家

01:43.833 --> 01:45.533
but that seems like a lot.
但这似乎很多。

01:45.533 --> 01:48.833
- It is!
- 这是！

01:48.833 --> 01:50.133
- Okay, quick survey!
- 好的，快速调查！

01:50.133 --> 01:53.200
Are you "busy-busy"
or just "busy"?
你“忙忙碌碌”吗
或者只是“忙”？

01:53.200 --> 01:54.933
- What's "busy-busy"?
- 什么是“忙忙”？

01:54.933 --> 01:56.133
No, no, no, don't tell me,
don't tell me!
不不不，别告诉我，
别告诉我！

01:56.133 --> 01:57.733
Don't tell me anything.
别告诉我任何事。

01:57.733 --> 02:01.233
Don't even tell me
what you're doing here.
甚至不告诉我
你在这里做什么。

02:01.233 --> 02:02.533
- I found a jump rope.
- 我找到了一根跳绳。

02:02.533 --> 02:04.833
- I said not to tell me!
- 我说了不要告诉我！

02:04.833 --> 02:08.233
You're ruining
my perfect afternoon.
你正在毁掉
我完美的下午。

02:08.233 --> 02:10.633
I'm spending some quality time
我正在度过一些美好的时光

02:10.633 --> 02:13.567
with someone who is
very important to me.
与某人
对我来说非常重要。

02:13.567 --> 02:17.467
- Oh, who's the lucky--
- 哦，谁是幸运的--

02:17.467 --> 02:20.567
- Ah, perfectly browned
toast points.
- 啊，完美的棕色
敬酒点。

02:20.567 --> 02:23.233
Sparkling kelp juice.
闪闪发光的海带汁。

02:23.233 --> 02:25.133
Here's to me.
这是给我的。

02:25.133 --> 02:26.133
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

02:26.133 --> 02:29.233
Oh, that simpering buffoon!
噢，那个傻笑的小丑！

02:29.233 --> 02:31.200
- You have a great vocabulary.
- 你的词汇量很大。

02:31.200 --> 02:32.300
- I know.
- 我知道。

02:32.300 --> 02:36.233
- Indubitably.
- 毫无疑问。

02:36.233 --> 02:39.967
- Go away!
- 离开！

02:39.967 --> 02:41.433
- Okay.
- 好的。

02:41.433 --> 02:43.433
- Wait! I thought you were
some other idiot.
- 等待！我以为你是
其他一些白痴。

02:43.433 --> 02:47.967
- No, I guess
I'm just this idiot.
- 不，我猜
我就是这个白痴。

02:57.633 --> 03:01.300
Why...
It's beautiful.
为什么...
很漂亮。

03:01.300 --> 03:04.767
- "You are cordially invited
to the fanciest and shmansiest
- “诚挚邀请您
到最奇特和最富有的

03:04.767 --> 03:06.800
"artistic event of the season,
“当季的艺术活动，

03:06.800 --> 03:10.100
the opening of
Galleria Diphtheria..."
的开幕
长廊白喉……”

03:10.100 --> 03:11.733
Oh, I've heard of that!
哦，我听说过！

03:11.733 --> 03:14.767
"Bikini Bottom's most exclusive
fine arts showcase.
“比基尼泳裤是最独特的
美术展示。

03:14.767 --> 03:17.200
"This invitation guarantees
the admittance
“这个邀请保证
准入

03:17.200 --> 03:19.067
"of Squidward Tentacles...
“章鱼哥的触手……

03:19.067 --> 03:22.100
"Squidward Tentacles
“章鱼哥的触手

03:22.100 --> 03:24.367
Ploos Onay?"
普洛斯·奥奈？”

03:24.367 --> 03:25.733
- It's a plus one.
- 这是一个加分项。

03:25.733 --> 03:27.300
- Aah! What are you
still doing here?
- 啊啊！你是什么
还在这里做什么？

03:27.300 --> 03:30.067
- It's not Ploos Onay.
- 这不是普洛斯·奥奈。

03:30.067 --> 03:33.267
It says
"plus one."
它说
“加一。”

03:33.267 --> 03:34.333
- Plus one.
- 加一。

03:34.333 --> 03:37.733
Oh, yeah, of course, plus one.
哦，是的，当然，再加一。

03:37.733 --> 03:39.833
Sure...
What's a plus one?
当然...
什么是加一？

03:39.833 --> 03:42.067
- Well, when you get
an invitation to a party,
- 好吧，当你得到
聚会邀请函，

03:42.067 --> 03:45.733
sometimes they put "plus one"
on it to tell you it's okay
有时他们会加上“加一”
告诉你没关系

03:45.733 --> 03:46.967
to bring along a friend.
带上一个朋友。

03:46.967 --> 03:48.400
- Do you have to do it?
- 你必须这样做吗？

03:48.400 --> 03:51.467
- Well, no, you could go alone.
- 好吧，不，你可以一个人去。

03:51.467 --> 03:53.100
It's just that everyone
would laugh at you,
只是大家
会嘲笑你，

03:53.100 --> 03:55.533
'cause they'd think
you were a friendless loser.
因为他们会认为
你是一个没有朋友的失败者。

03:55.533 --> 03:56.933
- What? Do you want me
to call your supervisor
- 什么？你想要我吗
打电话给你的主管

03:56.933 --> 04:00.167
and tell him
you're just standing around?
并告诉他
你只是站在旁边？

04:00.167 --> 04:04.167
- [sniffling]
- [抽鼻子]

04:04.167 --> 04:07.533
- You need to find a friend
to take as your plus one.
- 你需要找一个朋友
作为你的加一。

04:07.533 --> 04:08.733
SpongeBob: Somebody like me?
海绵宝宝：有人像我一样吗？

04:08.733 --> 04:11.133
- Aah!
- I like openings.
- 啊啊！
- 我喜欢空缺。

04:11.133 --> 04:13.100
- No! Not like you.
- 不！不像你。

04:16.433 --> 04:19.767
- Come on, jump rope.
I guess it's just you and me.
- 来吧，跳绳。
我想只有你和我。

04:22.967 --> 04:25.967
- Let's see here...
Friends!
- 让我们看看这里...
朋友们！

04:25.967 --> 04:29.300
[coughs]
[咳嗽]

04:29.300 --> 04:32.067
Friends.
朋友们。

04:32.067 --> 04:35.333
Friends.
朋友们。

04:38.900 --> 04:40.267
Hmm. Yeah.
唔。是的。

04:40.267 --> 04:43.067
I wonder if I still have
my receipt for this thing.
我想知道我是否还有
我这件事的收据。

04:43.067 --> 04:44.167
No big deal.
没什么大不了的。

04:44.167 --> 04:46.967
Anybody can make
a friend by...
任何人都可以制作
一个朋友，由...

04:46.967 --> 04:48.500
Tonight?
今晚？

04:48.500 --> 04:51.600
Let's see,
there must be someone.
让我们看看，
一定有人。

04:51.600 --> 04:53.167
Who's a real part
of your life, Squidward?
谁是真实的一部分
你的生活，章鱼哥？

04:53.167 --> 04:55.833
Who do you see every single day?
你每天都见到谁？

04:55.833 --> 04:58.533
Who do you know like
the back of your suction cups?
你认识谁
你的吸盘背面？

04:58.533 --> 05:01.067
[SpongeBob giggles maniacally]
[海绵宝宝疯狂地咯咯笑]

05:01.067 --> 05:04.300
But of course!
It's so simple.
但当然！
就是这么简单。

05:04.300 --> 05:06.100
- [laughs]
- [笑]

05:06.100 --> 05:10.167
- SpongeBob, I have
something to ask you.
- 海绵宝宝，我有
有件事想问你。

05:10.167 --> 05:11.867
- Of course I'll go
to the opening with you!
- 我当然会去
与你一起开幕！

05:11.867 --> 05:13.267
- That wasn't the question.
- 那不是问题。

05:13.267 --> 05:15.067
Which way did the mailman go?
邮递员往哪条路走？

05:15.067 --> 05:16.300
- Oh.
- 哦。

05:16.300 --> 05:18.467
He said he had a package
for the Widow Duncan.
他说他有一个包裹
为寡妇邓肯。

05:18.467 --> 05:20.067
I think he went--
我想他去了——

05:22.300 --> 05:25.233
- And then you just initial it
there, and we're all set.
- 然后你只需缩写它
到了，我们都准备好了。

05:25.233 --> 05:27.067
- Hey!
There you are!
- 嘿！
你在那里！

05:27.067 --> 05:27.867
- Not in the face!
- 不是在脸上！

05:27.867 --> 05:29.133
- What?
What are you...?
- 什么？
你是做什么的...？

05:29.133 --> 05:30.700
Oh.
[laughs]
哦。
[笑]

05:30.700 --> 05:34.233
You always were
a big kidder, huh?
你一直都是
一个大孩子，是吧？

05:34.233 --> 05:37.533
M-Mailman...Guy.
M-邮递员...家伙。

05:37.533 --> 05:39.667
- Actually I am not a kidder.
- 其实我不是一个爱开玩笑的人。

05:39.667 --> 05:41.700
I'm much more of an introvert.
我是一个比较内向的人。

05:41.700 --> 05:43.600
- I love introverts!
- 我喜欢内向的人！

05:43.600 --> 05:47.500
Why, I'm an introvert!
为什么，我是一个内向的人！

05:47.500 --> 05:50.133
[cheering]
[欢呼]

05:50.133 --> 05:51.833
- You are?
- 你是？

05:51.833 --> 05:55.167
- Say, I bet we have
a lot in common.
- 说，我打赌我们有
有很多共同点。

05:55.167 --> 05:57.700
- Oh, gee, I don't know.
- 哦，天哪，我不知道。

05:57.700 --> 05:59.533
I'm just a regular guy.
我只是一个普通人。

05:59.533 --> 06:00.967
When I'm not being
a mailman,
当我不在的时候
一名邮递员，

06:00.967 --> 06:03.300
I love going to
fancy art galleries.
我喜欢去
精美的艺术画廊。

06:03.300 --> 06:04.300
- That's me!
- 这就是我！

06:04.300 --> 06:05.800
- And eating delicious food.
- 还有吃美味的食物。

06:05.800 --> 06:08.267
- Oh, delicious food
is my favorite kind of food!
-哦，美味的食物
是我最喜欢的食物！

06:08.267 --> 06:10.633
Especially when that delicious
food is something you can...
尤其是那美味的时候
食物是你可以...

06:10.633 --> 06:13.067
both: Spread on a toast point!
两者：涂在吐司点上！

06:13.067 --> 06:16.100
[laughter]
[笑声]

06:17.167 --> 06:18.700
[sighing]
[叹气]

06:18.700 --> 06:20.633
- Once you've had
pointed toast,
- 一旦你拥有了
尖头吐司，

06:20.633 --> 06:23.067
you just never want
any other kind.
你只是永远不想要
任何其他类型。

06:23.067 --> 06:24.367
- Right?
- 正确的？

06:24.367 --> 06:26.333
And if there's one thing
I hate, it's...
如果有一件事
我讨厌，这是...

06:26.333 --> 06:27.700
- SpongeBob.
- Clarinets.
- 海绵宝宝。
- 单簧管。

06:27.700 --> 06:29.233
- Yeah, I know it--what?
- 是的，我知道 - 什么？

06:29.233 --> 06:30.467
- I mean, what kind of maniac
-我是说，什么样的疯子

06:30.467 --> 06:32.267
can enjoy the sound
of a clarinet?
可以享受声音
单簧管的？

06:32.267 --> 06:34.767
That squeaky, hollow,
kind of piercing howl
那吱吱作响、空洞的、
一种刺耳的嚎叫

06:34.767 --> 06:36.867
from the very pits of Gehenna.
来自地狱深渊。

06:36.867 --> 06:38.933
Only a deluded blowhard
with nothing to lose
只是一个受骗的吹牛者
没有什么可失去的

06:38.933 --> 06:41.867
could pick up a--ugh--clarinet
and think,
可以拿起一个——呃——单簧管
并认为，

06:41.867 --> 06:43.200
"Yeah, this is for me.
“是的，这是给我的。

06:43.200 --> 06:45.567
Let me inflict this pain
on the world."
让我承受这痛苦
在世界上。”

06:45.567 --> 06:46.600
Am I right, buddy?
我说得对吗，伙计？

06:46.600 --> 06:49.133
[nervous chuckle]
[紧张的笑声]

06:49.133 --> 06:51.467
Buddy?
伙伴？

06:51.467 --> 06:54.467
Stupid, stupid, stupid!
愚蠢，愚蠢，愚蠢！

06:54.467 --> 06:57.367
Why are you so darn opinionated,
Norton?
你怎么这么固执己见
诺顿？

06:57.367 --> 07:00.133
All you do with your searing
yet admirable honesty
你用你的灼热所做的一切
却又令人钦佩的诚实

07:00.133 --> 07:01.933
is drive everyone away.
就是把所有人都赶走。

07:01.933 --> 07:04.633
When's Norton's time?
诺顿的时间是什么时候？

07:04.633 --> 07:08.567
When's Norton's time to shine?
诺顿什么时候大放异彩？

07:08.567 --> 07:09.800
- Oh, Norton!
- 哦，诺顿！

07:09.800 --> 07:12.867
I've always taken a shine
to you.
我一直都散发着光芒
给你。

07:19.467 --> 07:22.600
- Oh, you think you know a guy.
- 哦，你认为你认识一个人。

07:22.600 --> 07:23.767
Oh, who are you kidding?
哦，你在跟谁开玩笑呢？

07:23.767 --> 07:25.733
It's not in the cards for you.
这不适合你。

07:25.733 --> 07:29.633
I bet not even this old tin can
would be my friend.
我打赌连这个旧锡罐也不行
会是我的朋友。

07:29.633 --> 07:31.833
- I'll be your friend.
- 我会成为你的朋友。

07:31.833 --> 07:34.200
- Who is this?
- It's me, SpongeBob.
- 这是谁？
- 是我，海绵宝宝。

07:37.067 --> 07:38.067
- SpongeBob!
- 海绵宝宝！

07:38.067 --> 07:39.267
- Yes, I'm still here.
- 是的，我还在这里。

07:39.267 --> 07:42.233
- I need to ask you
something important.
- 我需要问你
一些重要的事情。

07:42.233 --> 07:44.933
- You don't have to ask me
three times!
- 你不必问我
三遍！

07:44.933 --> 07:49.567
- Will you tell Larry
I want to talk to him?
- 你能告诉拉里吗
我想和他谈谈吗？

07:49.567 --> 07:51.067
- Oh.
- 哦。

07:51.067 --> 07:52.733
Okie doke.
好吧，多克。

07:53.967 --> 07:57.333
- So, Squidward,
whatcha wanna talk about?
- 那么，章鱼哥，
想聊什么？

07:57.333 --> 08:01.933
- Well, it's kind of hard
to put into words.
- 嗯，有点难
用言语表达。

08:01.933 --> 08:03.833
- Oh, I've been there, amigo.
- 哦，我去过那里，朋友。

08:03.833 --> 08:05.367
- You have?
- Sure!
- 你有吗？
- 当然！

08:05.367 --> 08:07.867
But nothing clears the sawdust
out of your brains
但没有什么可以清除木屑
从你的大脑中

08:07.867 --> 08:10.700
quicker than a ride
on a jet ski.
比乘车更快
在摩托艇上。

08:10.700 --> 08:12.667
Ever been on one of
these little babies?
曾经参加过其中之一
这些小婴儿？

08:12.667 --> 08:15.267
- Uh, no, they always seemed
a little...
- 呃，不，他们总是看起来
一点...

08:15.267 --> 08:16.833
sporty for me.
对我来说是运动型的。

08:16.833 --> 08:18.267
- Well, you only live once.
- 好吧，你只能活一次。

08:18.267 --> 08:22.667
And I just happen to have
an extra helmet.
而我恰好有
额外的头盔。

08:22.667 --> 08:24.900
- What the heck.
- 到底是什么啊。

08:24.900 --> 08:28.100
['60s surf rock]
[60 年代冲浪摇滚]

08:28.100 --> 08:36.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:47.200 --> 08:48.200
- Hey!
- 嘿！

08:48.200 --> 08:56.133
**
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:06.967 --> 09:10.100
[clarinet and bongos play]
[单簧管和手鼓演奏]

09:12.967 --> 09:14.500
- We make quite a team!
- 我们是一个很好的团队！

09:14.500 --> 09:15.800
- I'll say!
- 我会说！

09:15.800 --> 09:17.867
- You know, earlier today
I met a jerk
- 你知道，今天早些时候
我遇到了一个混蛋

09:17.867 --> 09:21.067
who said he didn't like
clarinet music.
谁说他不喜欢
单簧管音乐。

09:21.067 --> 09:23.300
- Hey, you know,
that's very un-cool.
- 嘿，你知道，
这非常不酷。

09:23.300 --> 09:25.367
What kind of
thoughtless ding dong
什么样的
没脑子的叮咚

09:25.367 --> 09:26.967
would knock
another man's passion?
会敲门
另一个男人的激情？

09:26.967 --> 09:28.733
- You know,
you're all right, Lester.
- 你知道，
你没事吧，莱斯特。

09:28.733 --> 09:30.067
- It's Larry.
- Whatever.
- 这是拉里。
- 任何。

09:30.067 --> 09:32.667
The point is, do you
want to go with me
重点是，你
想跟我一起去

09:32.667 --> 09:34.900
to a gallery opening tonight?
去今晚开幕的画廊吗？

09:34.900 --> 09:37.567
- Well, that's not
my kind of thing at all,
- 嗯，那不是
完全是我的风格，

09:37.567 --> 09:40.300
but for you, sure.
但对你来说，当然。

09:40.300 --> 09:41.767
I just need to
stop by the apartment
我只需要
停在公寓附近

09:41.767 --> 09:44.633
and make myself
a protein shake.
并使我自己
蛋白质奶昔。

09:44.633 --> 09:47.533
- What?
You don't need that glop.
- 什么？
你不需要那个咕噜声。

09:47.533 --> 09:49.067
- Oh, I wouldn't call it glop.
- 哦，我不会称之为“glop”。

09:49.067 --> 09:51.733
Protein shakes
saved my life, bro.
蛋白质奶昔
救了我的命，兄弟。

09:51.733 --> 09:53.600
- Oh, come on.
It's a fad.
- 哦，来吧。
这是一种时尚。

09:53.600 --> 09:56.067
You don't want to be
one of those mindless rubes
你不想成为
那些没脑子的乡巴佬之一

09:56.067 --> 09:59.900
who marches around
in a constant haze of stupidity.
谁走来走去
一直处于愚蠢的迷雾之中。

09:59.900 --> 10:02.333
"I love protein shakes.
“我喜欢蛋白质奶昔。

10:02.333 --> 10:05.500
"I'm the most gullible rube
on the planet.
“我是最容易上当受骗的乡巴佬
在这个星球上。

10:05.500 --> 10:07.067
"Duh, duh, duh.
“呃，呃，呃。

10:07.067 --> 10:10.667
Give me
my stupid protein shake."
给我
我愚蠢的蛋白质奶昔。”

10:10.667 --> 10:14.233
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

10:14.233 --> 10:18.833
- I mean...
- 我是说...

10:18.833 --> 10:21.167
So, we still on for tonight?
那么，我们今晚还继续吗？

10:21.167 --> 10:24.300
7:00-ish?
7:00 左右？

10:24.300 --> 10:25.500
[sighs]
[叹气]

10:25.500 --> 10:27.867
I guess
it's just you and me again.
我猜
又只剩你和我了。

10:30.933 --> 10:32.833
Ugh, what are you doing here?
呃，你在这里做什么？

10:32.833 --> 10:34.700
- Just playing draggy rope.
You want to play?
- 只是玩拖绳。
你想玩吗？

10:34.700 --> 10:35.867
- No.
- 不。

10:35.867 --> 10:37.433
You hold onto one end
of the rope,
你抓住一端
绳子的，

10:37.433 --> 10:39.533
and you drag it behind you
like a sea snake is chasing you.
然后你把它拖到身后
就像一条海蛇在追你。

10:39.533 --> 10:40.533
Like this.
Want to play?
像这样。
想玩吗？

10:40.533 --> 10:43.567
- Just get me out of here.
- 带我离开这里。

10:43.567 --> 10:44.700
- Will do.
- 会做。

10:44.700 --> 10:48.667
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:52.600 --> 10:53.733
- Thanks.
- 谢谢。

10:53.733 --> 10:56.533
- Anything for a friend.
- 为朋友做任何事情。

10:56.533 --> 10:58.700
- Friend?
- 朋友？

11:03.633 --> 11:06.600
Would you be my plus one?
你愿意成为我的加一吗？

11:06.600 --> 11:08.133
[gasps]
[喘气]

11:11.067 --> 11:15.500
Come on, SpongeBob.
来吧，海绵宝宝。

11:15.500 --> 11:18.633
- And here comes Squidward
Tentacles in what must be either
- 章鱼哥来了
触手一定是

11:18.633 --> 11:20.933
a bizarre piece
of performance art
一件奇怪的作品
行为艺术的

11:20.933 --> 11:22.767
or the saddest display
of loneliness
或最悲伤的表现
孤独的

11:22.767 --> 11:25.433
it has ever been
my displeasure to report.
曾经是
我不高兴地报告。

11:25.433 --> 11:28.867
One is inclined to suspect
the second thing I said.
人们倾向于怀疑
我说的第二件事。

11:28.867 --> 11:31.833
The thing about sadness.
关于悲伤的事情。

11:32.867 --> 11:36.200
- You'll always be my plus one.
- 你永远是我的加一。

11:36.200 --> 11:37.933
- Aww.
- 哇。

- 哇。